OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWet
OL,6,Fand windy during Tuesday with heavy
OL,7,Fburst and gales, mainly over hills.
OL,8,FRain and wind easing on Wednesday but
OL,9,Fstill cold and cloudy. On Thursday,
OL,10,Fdry with bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
